 381:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h **** 
 382:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h **** /** \brief API to disable global interrupt and return the previous status.
 383:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  *
 384:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  * This API can be used only to disable the global interrupts of caller CPU. It cannot be
 385:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  * used for this activity towards other CPUs.
 386:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  *
 387:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  * \return Previous status of global interrupt enable bit.
