 103:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Smm/Std/IfxSmmSysMode.h ****  *  // If application needs to disable bank in flash below macro can be used.
 104:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Smm/Std/IfxSmmSysMode.h ****  *  // iF all the banks are in sleep,..the code "IfxSmmSysMode_continueSleepSequenceInRAM" should b
