 850:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Pms/Std/IfxPmsEvr.h ****  * \param[in]	 samplingFactor Over-sampling Factor.
 851:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Pms/Std/IfxPmsEvr.h ****  * 								Range: 0x37 - 1.82 MHz (100 MHz/(54+1)) SMPS switching frequency.
 852:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Pms/Std/IfxPmsEvr.h ****  *									   0x7D - 0.8 MHz (100 MHz/(124+1)) SMPS switching frequency.
 853:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Pms/Std/IfxPmsEvr.h ****  *
 854:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Pms/Std/IfxPmsEvr.h ****  * \retval None
 855:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Pms/Std/IfxPmsEvr.h ****  *
 856:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Pms/Std/IfxPmsEvr.h ****  * Coding example:
