 182:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu_IntrinsicsGcc.h **** 
 183:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu_IntrinsicsGcc.h **** /** Return minimum of two sint16
